# ------------------------------------------------- running from the archive

[break] a-part-that-runs-nothing-passes
rule: A run from the archive that chooses no test fails: a job never passes having run nothing.
file: xtask/src/checks.rs
in: from_archive_run
find: "--no-tests=fail"
replace: "--no-tests=pass"
caught-by:
    xtask::bin/xtask checks::tests::the_archive_is_extracted_over_the_checkout_and_run_from_there

[break] archive-extracted-elsewhere
rule: The archive is extracted over the checkout, so the paths compiled into the tests hold.
file: xtask/src/checks.rs
in: extract_command
find: command.extend(["--extract-to".to_owned(), root]);
replace: command.extend(["--persist-extract-tempdir".to_owned(), root]);
caught-by:
    xtask::bin/xtask checks::tests::the_archive_is_extracted_over_the_checkout_and_run_from_there

